</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"insurance_cents\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"declare_time\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-27T18:30:00+08:00\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"items\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"item_no\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ITEM-1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"hs_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1901100000\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"goods_name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"婴幼儿配方奶粉\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"spec\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"900g/罐\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"qty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"unit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"千克\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"unit_price_cents\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">99000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"amount_cents\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">198000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"origin_country\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"AU\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"duty_mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"personal_use\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"signature\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"alg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SHA256withRSA\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"cert_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"base64...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"必填性严于一般接口\">必填性严于一般接口</h3><p>海关接口的必填校验比典型业务接口严格得多，原因是申报数据的缺失意味着法律责任无法归属。三组字段尤其不能省：<strong>主体备案编码</strong>（谁在申报）、<strong>订购人身份与收货信息</strong>（为谁申报）、<strong>关联单证编号</strong>（依据什么申报）。缺任何一组，海关都无法完成三单比对。</p>\n<p>工程上的做法是把必填性做成<strong>契约测试</strong>而不是运行时才发现：定义一份字段规范，在 CI 里用样例报文跑一遍校验，把「漏填某个必填字段」变成构建期错误。这比等到线上被退单再补要便宜得多。</p>\n<h3 id=\"金额与重量的表示\">金额与重量的表示</h3><p>申报报文里金额与重量都用定点数或整数，绝不用浮点。建议全部以最小单位整数传输（金额用分、重量用克），并在报文规范里写死单位，避免出现「一方按千克、一方按克」这类灾难性误解。这与第 2 章金额统一用整数分的约定一致，跨系统边界时更要把单位当作契约的一部分。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段组</th>\n<th>表示</th>\n<th>单位约定</th>\n<th>常见错误</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>金额</td>\n<td>整数</td>\n<td>分</td>\n<td>用浮点导致舍入漂移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>净重</td>\n<td>整数</td>\n<td>克</td>\n<td>与毛重混用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数量</td>\n<td>整数或定点</td>\n<td>法定计量单位</td>\n<td>与成交计量单位混用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完税价格</td>\n<td>整数</td>\n<td>分</td>\n<td>漏加运费保险费</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"接口契约-签名与幂等\">接口契约：签名与幂等</h2><h3 id=\"签名\">签名</h3><p>海关接口要求报文加签，用于证明报文的来源与完整性。典型方案是对报文正文按规范做摘要再用企业私钥签名，海关侧用备案公钥验签。这里有两个实现要点。</p>\n<p>第一，<strong>签名必须在序列化之后进行</strong>，且序列化必须是确定性的——同样的语义必须产生同样的字节，否则验签会随机失败。JSON 的键顺序在标准中不保证，因此要么用确定性的序列化方案（如 JSON Canonicalization Scheme）(<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8785.txt\">RFC 8785: JSON Canonicalization Scheme</a>)，要么在报文规范里显式规定键序。</p>\n<p>第二，<strong>签名字段本身不参与签名</strong>。这是一个常见疏漏：把 <code>signature</code> 一并算进摘要，会导致永远验不过。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[构造报文体] --&gt; B[移除 signature 字段]&#10;  B --&gt; C[确定性序列化]&#10;  C --&gt; D[SHA-256 摘要]&#10;  D --&gt; E[私钥签名]&#10;  E --&gt; F[附加 signature]&#10;  F --&gt; G[发送]&#10;  G --&gt; H[海关验签: 同样移除 signature]\">flowchart TD\n  A[构造报文体] --&gt; B[移除 signature 字段]\n  B --&gt; C[确定性序列化]\n  C --&gt; D[SHA-256 摘要]\n  D --&gt; E[私钥签名]\n  E --&gt; F[附加 signature]\n  F --&gt; G[发送]\n  G --&gt; H[海关验签: 同样移除 signature]</pre><h3 id=\"幂等\">幂等</h3><p>申报接口必须支持幂等，因为网络重试与人工重试都会发生，而重复申报的后果是严重的（重复申报意味着海关认为有两笔进口）。幂等的实现依赖一个由我方生成、全局唯一且与业务绑定的<strong>申报流水号</strong>（如 <code>manifest_no</code>），海关侧以它去重；我方侧也必须以它去重——即使海关接受重复，我方也不能发出两次。</p>\n<p>标准做法是申报流水号与订单号一对一（或一对多，一方支持重报修正），并在数据库里对「同一订单的同一版本申报」加唯一约束：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE declaration (&#10;  declaration_id BIGINT GENERATED ALWAYS AS IDENTITY PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  manifest_no    VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL UNIQUE,&#10;  order_no       VARCHAR(64) NOT NULL,&#10;  version        INTEGER     NOT NULL DEFAULT 1,&#10;  state          VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,   -- draft|sent|accepted|rejected|cancelled&#10;  request_digest BYTEA       NOT NULL,   -- 报文摘要, 用于排查&quot;发的是什么&quot;&#10;  sent_at        TIMESTAMPTZ NULL,&#10;  created_at     TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  CONSTRAINT uq_decl_order_version UNIQUE (order_no, version)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> declaration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  declaration_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> GENERATED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ALWAYS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IDENTITY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  manifest_no    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_no       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- draft|sent|accepted|rejected|cancelled</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  request_digest </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BYTEA</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 报文摘要, 用于排查\"发的是什么\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sent_at        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> uq_decl_order_version </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (order_no, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>uq_decl_order_version</code> 让「同一订单同一版本只能申报一次」成为数据库不变量。重报时必须递增 <code>version</code>，这样历史申报记录完整保留，而不会互相覆盖——保留历史对事后争议取证是必需的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"重试策略-超时不等于失败\">重试策略：超时不等于失败</h2><p>申报接口最危险的失效模式是<strong>把「没收到响应」当成「申报失败」</strong>，然后重新申报，造成重复申报。这是分布式系统里最经典的错误之一，业界对此有明确的标准做法：对于可能已经产生副作用的操作，重试必须携带幂等键，且超时后应<strong>先查询状态再决定是否重试</strong> (<a href=\"https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-httpapi-idempotency-key-header/\">draft-ietf-httpapi-idempotency-key-header: The Idempotency-Key HTTP Header Field</a>)。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[调用申报接口] --&gt; B{响应?}&#10;  B --&gt;|2xx 受理| C[置 state=accepted, 等回执]&#10;  B --&gt;|4xx 格式错| D[修正后新版本重报]&#10;  B --&gt;|5xx 或超时| E[置 state=unknown]&#10;  E --&gt; F[退避后查询: 按 manifest_no 查]&#10;  F --&gt;|已受理| C&#10;  F --&gt;|未找到| G{重试次数 &lt; 上限?}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| A&#10;  G --&gt;|否| H[转人工核查]\">flowchart TD\n  A[调用申报接口] --&gt; B{响应?}\n  B --&gt;|2xx 受理| C[置 state=accepted, 等回执]\n  B --&gt;|4xx 格式错| D[修正后新版本重报]\n  B --&gt;|5xx 或超时| E[置 state=unknown]\n  E --&gt; F[退避后查询: 按 manifest_no 查]\n  F --&gt;|已受理| C\n  F --&gt;|未找到| G{重试次数 &lt; 上限?}\n  G --&gt;|是| A\n  G --&gt;|否| H[转人工核查]</pre><p>关键设计是引入一个 <strong><code>unknown</code> 状态</strong>——它明确表示「我方不知道海关收到了没有」。没有这个状态，系统只能二选一，而两个选项都错。有 <code>unknown</code> 之后，处置路径变成「查询」，而查询是幂等且无副作用的。</p>\n<p>退避策略应使用指数退避加抖动，避免重试风暴同时打到海关接口（海关接口通常有严格的频率限制）。设第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次重试的基础延迟为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、退避系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>、抖动上限为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span></span></span></span>，则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mi>β</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_n = \\min(d_{max},\\ d_0 \\beta^{n}) \\cdot (1 + U(0, J))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U(0,J)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0, J]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 上的均匀随机数。抖动的作用是打散重试的同步性，这在多实例并发申报时尤其重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"上报频率与批量\">上报频率与批量</h2><p>申报接口通常有频率限制与批量能力。工程上要做两件事：<strong>用队列削峰</strong>（把申报请求放入队列，由有限的消费者按接口限速消费），以及<strong>区分单票与批量</strong>（批量接口吞吐高但单票可追溯性弱，适合低风险场景；单票接口清晰但慢）。</p>\n<p>不建议把「提高申报速度」当作优化目标。申报的价值在于正确与可追溯，速度是次要指标；为了快而并发打满接口，只会触发限流并让重试逻辑变得复杂。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>申报清单是轻量但法律效力等同报关单的申报单元，因此字段必填性极严、每次申报都必须可追责。</li>\n<li>报文分表头、表体、关联单证三层；主体备案编码、订购人信息、关联单证编号三组字段不可省。</li>\n<li>金额与重量一律用整数最小单位，单位约定必须写进报文规范。</li>\n<li>签名在确定性序列化之后进行，且签名字段本身不参与签名。</li>\n<li>幂等依赖我方生成的申报流水号，并用唯一约束保证「同一订单同一版本只申报一次」，重报必须递增版本。</li>\n<li>超时不等于失败：引入 <code>unknown</code> 状态，超时后先查询再决定是否重报；退避要加抖动。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>申报发出后如何接收与解释海关回执、如何维护清关状态机，见 <a href=\"customs-receipt-status\">海关回执与清关状态机</a>；放行之外的查验、扣货等异常分支如何处置，见 <a href=\"release-hold-customs\">放行/查验/扣货处置</a>；构成申报内容的三单如何产生，见 <a href=\"../three-docs-match/order-payment-logistics-doc\">订单单/支付单/运单数据模型</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"清单申报接口与报文","id":"清单申报接口与报文"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"申报报文的字段组织","id":"申报报文的字段组织"},{"level":3,"text":"必填性严于一般接口","id":"必填性严于一般接口"},{"level":3,"text":"金额与重量的表示","id":"金额与重量的表示"},{"level":2,"text":"接口契约：签名与幂等","id":"接口契约-签名与幂等"},{"level":3,"text":"签名","id":"签名"},{"level":3,"text":"幂等","id":"幂等"},{"level":2,"text":"重试策略：超时不等于失败","id":"重试策略-超时不等于失败"},{"level":2,"text":"上报频率与批量","id":"上报频率与批量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"不一致拦截与异常处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-import-three-docs-match/three-docs-match/mismatch-intercept-handle"},"next":{"title":"海关回执与清关状态机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-import-three-docs-match/customs-declare-receipt/customs-receipt-status"}}